---
// ===== EN/FR SWITCHER =====
// Lives in the footer rather than floating over the page. Pages with a mobile
// drawer also carry a copy inside it (VerticalNav's .vn-lang row), which is
// the mobile route; the footer copy hides under that on small screens so the
// two never both appear. /sponsor has no drawer, so there the footer copy is
// the only switcher and stays visible at every width.
//
// Behaviour lives in Layout.astro — setLang/positionLangThumbs query
// `.lang-rail, .vn-lang`. Nothing here owns state.
---

<div class="lang-rail lang-rail--footer" role="group" aria-label="Language">
  <span class="lang-thumb" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <button id="lang-en" class="lang-btn active" data-lang="en" aria-pressed="true" title="English" onclick="setLang('en')">EN</button>
  <span class="lang-rail-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <button id="lang-fr" class="lang-btn" data-lang="fr" aria-pressed="false" title="Français" onclick="setLang('fr')">FR</button>
</div>
